    "title": "Emmy Noether: Modern LaTeX Working Corpus and Multilingual Translation Drafts (R813 / Integrated v12 Source-Control Update)",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.21300773",
    "publication_date": "2026-07-10",
    "description": "<p>This is the reader-facing Emmy Noether working record for the Modern LaTeX Editions of Mathematics Manuscripts project. This version fronts <code>00_Noether_German_Cumulative_Working_SourceControl_R813_v12_20260710.pdf</code>, a 466-page German source-control reader, and supplies the integrated R805-R813 TeX, audit ledgers, source witnesses, diffs, render checks, and build logs in <code>07_Noether_Current_SourceControl_Integrated_v12_R805_R813_20260710.zip</code>.</p><p><strong>What changed:</strong> v12 integrates and independently checks R805-R813 on top of v11. The final semantic delta is confined to Paper 19. R805 resolves the printed p57 terminal family; R809 replaces the temporary early-band R807 reading; R810 resolves the p65-p66 class-decomposition family; R812 was reconstructed from the R811/R813 delta and checked against p61-p64 witnesses; R813 restores three source-backed emphases on pp.65-66. Superseded R796/R804/R805 current-control files are removed from this latest surface but remain preserved in earlier Zenodo versions.</p><p><strong>Status caveat:</strong> this is a serious source-repair and translation working corpus, not OCR-only, but it is not a critical edition, whole-corpus source-faithfulness certification, paper-by-paper certification, multilingual synchronization, or publication-grade proofreading. Filenames containing <code>COMPLETE</code> are inherited local-task labels only.</p><p><strong>GitHub:</strong> corrections, source comparisons, LaTeX fixes, and translation improvements can be suggested via issues or pull requests at <a href=\"https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts\">https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/modern-latex-manuscripts</a>.</p>",
